      "description": "Fahr-/Bremshebel ThrottleAndBrakeHandle, an incremental handle: Brake + 0 / Brake hold 0.15 / Brake - 0.3 / Off 0.5 / Throttle - 0.7 / Throttle hold 0.85 / Throttle + 1. The game moves it one notch per set and the two ends are spring positions (a set pulses the traction or brake demand and the handle falls back to the hold notch), so push the TCA lever to the far end to raise power, bring it back to the hold band to keep it, and the mirror for the brake. Fahren is pushed away, so inverted: Throttle + raw 0..0.06, hold 0.07..0.21, Throttle - 0.24..0.40, Off 0.47..0.53, Brake - 0.60..0.76, hold 0.79..0.93, Brake + 0.94..1",
